{"3223470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Conquero : Rise or Kneel", "steam_appid": 3223470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/468e53be29a8cee79fbea08535defe54.avif?t=1765990895\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/ce74a1e41b2db3fa1408c98597d3cefe.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/ce74a1e41b2db3fa1408c98597d3cefe.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquero</strong> is a 3D turn-based strategy game. It aims to provide players with a fast and fun experience. In addition to fast-paced gameplay, players must conquer the right territories at the right time, develop their armies and buildings through research, hire mercenaries and manage resources correctly, and make alliances with the right lords to become the sole leader of the entire map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/1fb30b3212387d155dc84c456907892c.poster.avif?t=1765990895\" width=800 height=417 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/1fb30b3212387d155dc84c456907892c.webm?t=1765990895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/885be8977b9961901a5f7665f3288060.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/885be8977b9961901a5f7665f3288060.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/1c0e4e08943c3d2c6f2958922401daea.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/1c0e4e08943c3d2c6f2958922401daea.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research -</strong> make researches to build or increase army strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build -</strong> to produce resources build all relevant buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happiness</strong> – increase public happiness to attract more people and boost tax income</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tax Rate</strong> – set tax levels to balance gold income and citizen satisfaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Rations</strong> – adjust food allowance to influence public happiness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Armies and Buildings -</strong> level up armies and buildings to increase their strength and efficiency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Armies -</strong> transform your land units to sea units and vice-versa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenaries -</strong> hire mercenaries to fight for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Planning - </strong>carefully take care of resource levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merchants -</strong> buy and sell goods to provide your realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Borders - </strong>gain most of the lands before other nobles do</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siege -</strong> siege castles and towns to conquer them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disasters -</strong> fight with not-curable diseases on crops and armies, fight with wildfires and storms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy -</strong> send Insult or Compliment letters to other nobles or send gold as a gift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Ruins -</strong> reveal the long-forgotten resources or reveal the iron deposits where you can build mines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandits and Pirates -</strong> in the woods and by the sea, you might come across tough Bandits and Pirates who'll ask for your gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/8488c13d10b276ec186974dec303339f.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/8488c13d10b276ec186974dec303339f.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/468e53be29a8cee79fbea08535defe54.avif?t=1765990895\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/ce74a1e41b2db3fa1408c98597d3cefe.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/ce74a1e41b2db3fa1408c98597d3cefe.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquero</strong> is a 3D turn-based strategy game. It aims to provide players with a fast and fun experience. In addition to fast-paced gameplay, players must conquer the right territories at the right time, develop their armies and buildings through research, hire mercenaries and manage resources correctly, and make alliances with the right lords to become the sole leader of the entire map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/1fb30b3212387d155dc84c456907892c.poster.avif?t=1765990895\" width=800 height=417 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/1fb30b3212387d155dc84c456907892c.webm?t=1765990895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/885be8977b9961901a5f7665f3288060.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/885be8977b9961901a5f7665f3288060.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/1c0e4e08943c3d2c6f2958922401daea.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/1c0e4e08943c3d2c6f2958922401daea.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research -</strong> make researches to build or increase army strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build -</strong> to produce resources build all relevant buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happiness</strong> – increase public happiness to attract more people and boost tax income</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tax Rate</strong> – set tax levels to balance gold income and citizen satisfaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Rations</strong> – adjust food allowance to influence public happiness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Armies and Buildings -</strong> level up armies and buildings to increase their strength and efficiency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Armies -</strong> transform your land units to sea units and vice-versa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenaries -</strong> hire mercenaries to fight for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Planning - </strong>carefully take care of resource levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merchants -</strong> buy and sell goods to provide your realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Borders - </strong>gain most of the lands before other nobles do</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siege -</strong> siege castles and towns to conquer them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disasters -</strong> fight with not-curable diseases on crops and armies, fight with wildfires and storms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy -</strong> send Insult or Compliment letters to other nobles or send gold as a gift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Ruins -</strong> reveal the long-forgotten resources or reveal the iron deposits where you can build mines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandits and Pirates -</strong> in the woods and by the sea, you might come across tough Bandits and Pirates who'll ask for your gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras/8488c13d10b276ec186974dec303339f.avif?t=1765990895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223470/extras_big/8488c13d10b276ec186974dec303339f.avif?t=1765990895 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Conquero is a turn-based strategy game with procedurally generated maps. Research, build, and upgrade armies. Manage food, taxes, and happiness to grow your realm. Hire mercenaries, explore ruins, siege castles, and fa